      "content": "that makes sense. to get the \"gritty\" vibe we want for the more intense scenes, can you go into more detail about the groups that might represent the more \"at-risk\" or tougher side of the neighborhood? like, if we're filming a scene in a darker alley or a particularly rougher block, what kind of people would we expect to see there? just trying to make sure we don't accidentally cast people who look too \"wholesome\" for that part of the Bronx.",
